      "description": "A flat ingredient ledger with aligned quantities and source affordances; sample content is illustrative.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-sheet\" aria-labelledby=\"ds-recipe-title\"><h2 class=\"ds-recipe-title\" id=\"ds-recipe-title\">Cumin rice</h2><p class=\"ds-origin\">Cook’s original recipe · 4 servings</p><div class=\"ds-ledger-label\"><span>INGREDIENT</span><span>FOR YOUR TABLE</span></div><div class=\"ds-ingredient\"><span class=\"ds-ingredient-name\">Rice<small class=\"ds-original\">2 bowls in the original</small></span><span class=\"ds-quantity ds-unresolved\">Measure needed<small class=\"ds-source-hint\">Ask the cook</small></span></div><p class=\"ds-recipe-note\"><strong>Times stay as spoken.</strong> Serving arithmetic does not predict how a larger batch will cook.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-sheet{font-family:var(--font,MB,'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif);max-width:470px;padding:24px 27px 16px;border:1px solid var(--line,#d7d8d0);border-radius:var(--radius,14px);background:var(--white,#fff);color:var(--ink,#292b28)}.ds-recipe-title{margin:0;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.1}.ds-origin{margin:7px 0 23px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#65675f)}.ds-ledger-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--muted,#65675f)}.ds-ingredient{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:13px 0}.ds-ingredient-name{font-size:15px;font-weight:500}.ds-original{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:400;margin-top:1px;color:var(--muted,#65675f)}.ds-quantity{text-align:right;font-size:18px;font-weight:600;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1.2;max-width:52%;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-unresolved{color:#9c401c;font-size:14px}.ds-source-hint{display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:450;margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted,#65675f)}.ds-recipe-note{margin-top:9px;padding-top:14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#d7d8d0);font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#65675f)}.ds-recipe-note strong{color:var(--ink,#292b28)}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-sheet{padding:23px 21px 18px}.ds-recipe-title{font-size:25px}}"
